{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And all, I will cut off</b> — in the plural, like <b>and he fought</b> with Israel, upon Balak. Also <b>give might</b> to Elohim." "<b>The horns of the righteous shall be lifted up</b> — the opposite of <b>I will cut off</b>."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 75, :notes {0 "Resolved בדיבור as 'in the plural' (i.e., plural verb form with singular or collective subject), the standard grammatical sense in Ibn Ezra's usage; the example וילחם בישראל על בלק likely cites the plural usage at Numbers 31:7."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:34:37.798405262Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}